Hello,
I am using poppr to conduct an AMOVA to assess population structure using 12 microsatellite loci. In the literature I have seen the statistics Fct, Fsc, and Fst reports as opposed to the phi stats that are reported with the poppr amova. I have read that these F-statistics are an analog to phi-statistics however I am interested in reporting the F-stats as that seems to be the standard in the field. Is there any way to calculate these stats using poppr or the given phi-stats? Any info would be appreciated.

