I think this should be possible. It should be noted that RClone already can calculate this metric, but this would still be useful to have in poppr so long as it returns the same results as RClone's version.

If you are familiar with Git and GitHub, would you mind making a pull request for the modification? I would recommend using the {usethis} package to set things up: https://usethis.r-lib.org/reference/pr_init.html

